  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam is in the park. May and Pat are there too. \"Let's play a game!\" says Sam. \"I say it. You do it.\" \"Clap!\" says Sam. May and Pat clap. \"Jump!\" says Sam. They jump. \"Walk!\" says Sam. They walk.",
      "\"Run!\" says Sam. Pat runs and runs. A bird sits in the tree. It looks at them. A bee comes too. Now May says the words. \"Swim!\" says May. They swim on the grass. Pat laughs. \"Can you swim in a park?\"",
      "Sam has a ball. \"Do you like ball games?\" asks May. \"I like badminton,\" says Sam. \"I like basketball,\" says May. Sam throws the ball. Pip runs fast. He jumps and catches it. \"Good dog, Pip!\" says Pat. Pip says, \"Woof!\""
    ],
    "summary": "Sam, May, and Pat play an action game in the park. Then Pip catches a ball.",
